    "updated_at": "2023-01-27T16:31:47Z",
    "body": "Compatible in the form of `show_milliseconds` has a function or the configuration just continues to exist?\r\n\r\nThe change to `u64` is great of course. It makes the whole thing a bit easier.\r\n\r\nMy current plan is: There are variables for days (although I hardly think anyone will need this), hours, minutes, seconds, milliseconds and the absolute time in milliseconds.\r\nThis would allow formats like `[$total]ms` or `[$hh]:[$mm]:$[ss]`.\r\n\r\nThoughts?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
